Presmium's npm packages hold Presmium's own code. Their dependencies are
installed from npm, each with its own license, and are not part of them.
The sites Presmium builds (the web form and the slides) also carry
third-party runtimes and fonts, copied from those dependencies. They are
listed below with their licenses; each runtime is published next to its
license file.


